    1. main (local, main)
    2. far (http-proxy, replica)
? backends: a number to edit, [a]dd, [r]emove N, [d]one [d] -> a
? type (gcs, http-proxy, local, s3) [local] -> local
? backend name -> copy
? role (main, replica, backfill, readOnly) [main] -> 
? Store root -> /srv/copy
? Verify chunk writes [true] -> 
    1. main (local, main)
    2. far (http-proxy, replica)
    3. copy (local, main)
? backends: a number to edit, [a]dd, [r]emove N, [d]one [d] -> d
? mount it as a folder on this machine (fuse) [no] -> 
? serve it to other machines over HTTPS (http-proxy) [yes] -> 
? Port -> 
